  "transcription": "Additional results\n(1). $\\dfrac{x + \\frac{x^4}{1-x^4} + \\frac{x^9}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)} + \\frac{x^{16}}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)(1-x^{12})} + \\cdots}{1 + \\frac{x}{1-x^4} + \\frac{x^4}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)} + \\frac{x^9}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)(1-x^{12})} + \\cdots}$\n$= \\frac{x}{1+}\\frac{x}{1+}\\frac{x^2}{1+}\\frac{x^3}{1+}\\frac{x^4}{1+}\\cdots\\cdots$\n(2) I have found empirically that\n$1 + \\frac{x}{1-x^4} + \\frac{x^4}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)} + \\frac{x^9}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)(1-x^{12})} + \\cdots$\n$= \\dfrac{(1-x^2)(1-x^6)(1-x^{10})(1-x^{14})\\cdots\\cdots}{(1-x)(1-x^6)(1-x^{11})(1-x^{16})\\cdots\\cdots(1-x^4)(1-x^9)(1-x^{14})\\cdots}$\nand also that\n(3) $x + \\frac{x^4}{1-x^4} + \\frac{x^9}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)} + \\frac{x^{16}}{(1-x^4)(1-x^8)(1-x^{12})} + \\cdots$\n$= \\dfrac{x(1-x^2)(1-x^6)(1-x^{10})(1-x^{14})\\cdots\\cdots}{(1-x^2)(1-x^7)(1-x^{12})\\cdots\\cdots(1-x^3)(1-x^8)(1-x^{13})\\cdots}$\n(4) $5x\\,\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(1 + \\frac{x}{1+}\\frac{x^2}{1+}\\frac{x^3}{1+}\\frac{x^4}{1+}\\cdots\\right)$\n$= \\left\\{1 - \\dfrac{(1-x)^5(1-x^2)^5(1-x^3)^5(1-x^4)^5\\cdots}{(1-x^5)(1-x^{10})(1-x^{15})(1-x^{20})\\cdots\\cdots}\\right\\}\\cdot\\left(1 + \\frac{x}{1+}\\frac{x^2}{1+}\\frac{x^3}{1+\\cdots}\\right)$\n(5) If $v = \\frac{[-x-]{+x+}}{1+}\\frac{x^5}{1+}\\frac{x^{10}}{1+}\\frac{x^{15}}{1+}\\cdots$\nthen $x\\left(v + \\frac{1}{v}\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac{(1-x^5)^5(1-x^{10})^5(1-x^{15})^5\\cdots}{(1-x)(1-x^2)(1-x^3)\\cdots\\cdots}$\n$= 1 + \\sum_{n=1}^{n=\\infty}\\left(\\frac{nx^n}{1-x^n} - \\frac{25n\\,x^{25n}}{1-x^{25n}}\\right).$",
